# strand-eval reference recordings (docs/eval.md, "Reference recordings"). Written by `strand-eval approve` and `verdict`; a block edited by hand fails its seal.
ref "flip-undrawn-pass"
verdict good
note "integration-r7 part 2: the regression rebuilt from neutral shapes (a sheet, a tag, a counter, a plain box; springs 500/0.7 and 880/0.8, none of the owner shell's values); read k0-33: the counter stays at y 17 on every frame while the sheet widens and the tag mounts, its x gliding with its laid x (414, 422, 450, 458, 445 ... 388), the tag entering from opacity 0.14 at scale; flip-undrawn-pass.patch fails bystander on #count y at k1 and frame-lead.patch continuity on #count"
